  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 씨,\n긴히 드릴 말씀이 있습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000000020C528002C000AAE34D7880020B4DCB9B40020B9D0C500C7740020C788C2B5B2C8B2E4002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "개인적인 이야기이긴 합니다만,\n딸에게 어떤 포켓몬을<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n생일 선물로 주고 싶어서 말입니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC1CC778C801C7780020C774C57CAE30C774AE340020D569B2C8B2E4B9CC002C000AB538C5D0AC8C0020C5B4B5A40020D3ECCF13BAACC74400100001BE00000AC0DDC77C0020C120BB3CB85C0020C8FCACE00020C2F6C5B4C11C0020B9D0C785B2C8B2E4002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "선물하려는 건\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>따라큐<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>라는 포켓몬입니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C120BB3CD558B824B2940020AC74000A00100002FF000006B530B77CD05000100002FF000000B77CB2940020D3ECCF13BAACC785B2C8B2E4002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "따라큐는 야행성이라 어린이가 돌보기에는\n아직 이르다고 설명했습니다만...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B530B77CD050B2940020C57CD589C131C774B77C0020C5B4B9B0C774AC000020B3CCBCF4AE30C5D0B294000AC544C9C10020C774B974B2E4ACE00020C124BA85D588C2B5B2C8B2E4B9CC002E002E002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "선물해 주지 않을 거면\n머리끈을 돌려달라더군요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C120BB3CD5740020C8FCC9C00020C54AC7440020AC70BA74000ABA38B9ACB048C7440020B3CCB824B2ECB77CB354AD70C694002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "예, 제가 하고 있는 머리끈은\n딸이 선물해 준 겁니다.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n메리프의 털로 만들었다더군요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C608002C0020C81CAC000020D558ACE00020C788B2940020BA38B9ACB048C740000AB538C7740020C120BB3CD5740020C9000020AC81B2C8B2E4002E00100001BE01000ABA54B9ACD504C7580020D138B85C0020B9CCB4E4C5C8B2E4B354AD70C694002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이제는 저의 아이덴티티나 마찬가지라\n돌려주는 건 곤란하단 말이죠.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774C81CB2940020C800C7580020C544C774B374D2F0D2F0B0980020B9C8CC2CAC00C9C0B77C000AB3CCB824C8FCB2940020AC740020ACE4B780D558B2E80020B9D0C774C8E0002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "따라큐는\n칼로스지방에 없는 포켓몬이지만,<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n이차원 미르에서라면\n만나실 수 있을지도 모릅니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B530B77CD050B294000ACE7CB85CC2A4C9C0BC29C5D00020C5C6B2940020D3ECCF13BAACC774C9C0B9CC002C00100001BE01000AC774CC28C6D00020BBF8B974C5D0C11CB77CBA74000AB9CCB098C2E40020C2180020C788C744C9C0B3C40020BAA8B985B2C8B2E4002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "따라큐를 만나시게 되거든\n잡아서 제게 양보해 주시면 감사하겠습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B530B77CD050B97C0020B9CCB098C2DCAC8C0020B418AC70B4E0000AC7A1C544C11C0020C81CAC8C0020C591BCF4D5740020C8FCC2DCBA740020AC10C0ACD558ACA0C2B5B2C8B2E4002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "따라큐를 주실 건가요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B530B77CD050B97C0020C8FCC2E40020AC74AC00C694003F001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "드릴게요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B4DCB9B4AC8CC69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기다려 주세요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30B2E4B8240020C8FCC138C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "개인적인 일로 부탁을 드려 죄송하지만\n부디 따라큐를 제게 양보해 주십쇼!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC1CC778C801C7780020C77CB85C0020BD80D0C1C7440020B4DCB8240020C8C4C1A1D558C9C0B9CC000ABD80B5140020B530B77CD050B97C0020C81CAC8C0020C591BCF4D5740020C8FCC2EDC1FC0021001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "정말 감사합니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C815B9D00020AC10C0ACD569B2C8B2E4002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "따라큐는 드래곤타입에 강한\n페어리타입을 가지고 있습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B530B77CD050B2940020B4DCB798ACE4D0C0C785C5D00020AC15D55C000AD398C5B4B9ACD0C0C785C7440020AC00C9C0ACE00020C788C2B5B2C8B2E4002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "언젠가 딸이 훌륭한 트레이너가 돼서\n제 할비롱을 이기는 날이 올지도 모르겠네요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B8C820AC000020B538C7740020D6CCB96DD55C0020D2B8B808C774B108AC000020B3FCC11C000AC81C0020D560BE44B871C7440020C774AE30B2940020B0A0C7740020C62CC9C0B3C40020BAA8B974ACA0B124C694002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그때 어떻게 반응하느냐에 따라\n아버지로서의 제 역량을 알 수 있겠군요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B54C0020C5B4B5BBAC8C0020BC18C751D558B290B0D0C5D00020B530B77C000AC544BC84C9C0B85CC11CC7580020C81C0020C5EDB7C9C7440020C54C0020C2180020C788ACA0AD70C6940021001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 씨, 이번 건도 포함해서\n늘 감사하고 있습니다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1400,
